{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18506","headline":"述德上兴元严仆射 · 欧阳詹","name":"述德上兴元严仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山横碧立并雄岷，大阜洪川共降神。\n心合云雷清祸乱，力回天地作阳春。\n非熊德媿当周辅，称杰叨慙首汉臣。\n何幸腐儒无一艺，得爲门下食鱼人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}